  "message": "Fix UAF in CreatePsDec reset branch\n\nCreatePsDec supports a reset an open instance path. If any later\nstep fails, control jumps to bail.\n\nThis commit fixes the UAF by deleting only locally-allocated buffers\ninside CreatePsDec and explicitly calling DeletePsDec() in the caller\nsbrDecoder_ResetElement if CreatePsDec fails. DeletePsDec() will reclaim\nthe space and clear the handle.\n\nAutogenerated by MendIt (go/androidmendit)\n\nBug: 503543341\nTest: atest libSBRdec_test --host\nFlag: EXEMPT BUGFIX\n(cherry picked from commit 731f21fc0465ed449f1ea4f2eeb1a2caa018d10f)\nCherrypick-From: https://googleplex-android-review.googlesource.com/q/commit:91ff11fae88c6b2fc8be476ccdff31d13eb8b062\nMerged-In: Ie5e018299ab8ef2856efd3508a4415261c47df3c\nChange-Id: Ie5e018299ab8ef2856efd3508a4415261c47df3c\n",
